{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_8_level_main_08-14_beg",
  "groupId": "main_8",
  "stageId": "main_08-14",
  "title": "甦醒，浮出夢鄉",
  "storyCode": "M8-8",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-14_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6ae6053e9dcf2ae75ce70d1434eb9b6213636c7b4400f3b8954960fffdc07a30",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那些烏薩斯的混帳的確混在感染者和雇傭兵隊伍裡！他們假裝是整合運動，所有人都長點眼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "除了剛才塗上漆的人，一個都別放過！哪怕是想往裡面再走一步，都直接幹掉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_059",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可那些整合運動，也是被煽動被騙過來的吧？！一定要殺了他們嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這個問題，你該留給過幾分鐘被他們幹掉的你自己！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_090",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Guard，敵人的火力很猛！那可不是整合運動該有的火力！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_059",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "該有的火力是什麼意思？！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果給我們所有的炮手都配上新式兵器，我們大概能直接攻下切城，用不著靠天災。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們已經顧不得會不會露餡了，現在的他們就是拼了命地往裡衝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那為什麼塔露拉沒把他們放在身邊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因為她害怕！她害怕我們會識破這些人的身手，識破他們的詭計！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_090",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "人太多的話，恐怕她也沒法蓋得住了。而且，那些武器他們是沒法直接拿在手上的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_090",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那些武器怕是早就藏在核心城各個地方，就等這個最混亂的時候了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們一開始就是被設計來對付我們的！他們想要殺掉我們所有人。但他們錯了！不是他們殺掉我們，是我們會殺掉他們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "保持陣型！前進！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_090",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "做什麼？！你們要......要離開陣地？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "羅德島的，看清楚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們就是戰爭的陣地！我們在哪裡，陣線就在哪裡！前進！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "這樣不行的，我們的隊伍跟不上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們會頂住，找機會做掉他們，你們就能跟上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_059",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "幻影弩手們，做得到嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒了隊長，我們沒什麼優勢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但你們可以做到！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "浮士德隊長為了我們連命都可以不要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......如果那個羅德島的兔子真的可以為隊長報仇，那我們的命也確實不算什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不用這樣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊......羅德島的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "直接轟炸他們的陣地，是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Raidian，收到訊息的話，幫我干擾他們的通訊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一瞬間裡讓他們的耳機都爆炸就好了。啊，嗯，聲音大一點，不是真的爆炸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當然把他們的耳朵炸掉也是可以的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好的，五秒是嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "四秒，幻影弩手們，準備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "三秒。Guard，讓隊伍散開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_059",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我信你一回。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "盾衛，撤盾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你會暴露！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也沒關係。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "可是，遊擊隊兄弟......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一秒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_058",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "肯把命託付給我們的人，我們的命，當然也由她！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，那些混在整合運動裡的傢伙突然倒下了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "三把。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Guard曾經思考過很多次這個問題。\n現在他又再一次問自己，羅德島那些擁有奇異力量的幹員們，那些能夠主宰戰場的幹員們，自己究竟該怎麼看待他們？\n後來，Ace給了他一個答案。Scout給了他一個答案。現在迷迭香，Rosmontis，也給了他一個答案。\n巨劍砸向了敵人的火炮，薩卡茲雇傭兵抬起手中巨弩，Guard不禁大喊出聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_059",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "盾衛，舉盾！保護迷迭香！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他們是一個小隊。他們需要保護，需要協同，需要理解。\n他們是人。和自己一樣奮戰著的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "吃下！眼睛很尖，小兄弟！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝謝你，Guard。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不客氣。繼續吧，迷迭香。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "盾衛們，小隊幹員們，感染者們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "朋友，家人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們會回家。我們打贏他們，阿米婭打敗塔露拉，然後我們回家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我在哪裡？\n我該回去了。\n有一些冷......\n那些黑影是怎麼回事呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "啊，想起來了，它們快要凍死了，所以我把什麼分給了它們。\n唔，好冷。\n我把什麼分給了它們？\n想不起來了。好像是很重要的東西。好像有人告訴我絕對不要把這東西交給別人。\n那我為什麼......會給它們？\n是因為這東西不重要嗎？應該不是吧。如果太冷的話，我也會消失的。\n......\n我知道了。\n是因為我的朋友們一定會這樣做的。\n我的朋友......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "有很嚴厲的人。他會把我當朋友嗎？\n有會給我唱歌的人。我很久沒聽她唱歌了。\n有眼神很凶的人。但她做的東西很好吃。\n有我最重要的人。是她告訴我可以去哪裡。但是......我不明白。我實在是不太明白。\n還有不說話的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "有什麼來了。\n好多黑色的影子。\n它們要做什麼？\n它們也要我的生命嗎？\n對，生命。\n生命是......重要的。\n是這樣嗎？\n生命這東西，有用嗎？\n黑色的影子，離我好近。\n......它們是來奪走我的生命的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "那是......什麼？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "退後一些，博士。別上前去。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "我們還是來晚了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "那已經不是一個感染者了。\n那是另一種生物。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "......悲慘。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "這種案例即使是我，也只在過去見過一次。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "施術者與他的受害者連成一體，肉體與源石結成的山丘上開出易碎的花朵。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "粉末隨風飄撒，任何途經那片遭詛咒之地的人都將因沾染粉塵而感染——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "——並且，那個不幸遭害的人將成為新的宿主，去傳播更多苦痛與死亡。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你似乎不只是在描述一件往事。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "任何修辭對這樁慘劇而言都是侮辱，我所說的字字屬實。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "感染源的活力如同毒藥，它對生物的毒害不會自然停止。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "那時我暗下決心，絕不讓這類事件重演。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "然而事與願違，我意識到，這些事情只會在我眼前一次又一次地發生。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（低吟）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "......它的意識似乎已經陷入了沉睡。它在無意識地宣洩。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "那些沒有被它操控的牧群薩卡茲們，似乎也是因為它沒有嘗試去控制某個個體。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "自由。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "很諷刺。牧群竟然會有自由。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（哼鳴）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "果然，它就是源石粉塵大規模擴散的元兇。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "不行。如果牧群薩卡茲最後也會向這個形態轉化，損失將不可估量。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "它的粉塵已經不再是一種單純的源石技藝。它甚至會感染普通人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "開滿了數座城市的源石花，這種景象我不想再看見。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "Dr.{@nickname}。 我們要先制服它，停止牧群的擴大，阻止感染的傳播。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "它是......？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "你認識它？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "是。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "不太清楚。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "不。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "我並不清楚你在思考什麼，博士。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "我不是審判者，Dr.{@nickname}。 我只是個醫生。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "這片大地身患頑疾，如果沒有人去醫治它，它會產生什麼樣的後果？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "當然，生物有免疫系統，假使大地有，它也許能從病創中自我修復......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "但我們並不能生存在一片更加貧瘠的土地上。它會因此衰弱，而我們會因此而死。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "而我們面前的感染者......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（嘶聲）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "首先說好，哪怕一種惡疾在現下被人視作絕症，在一個醫生眼裡那也絕非等同死亡。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "“特效藥還未面世，患者的生命依然受到嚴重的威脅”，僅此而已。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "醫生絕不會承認——哪怕所有人都如此確信，醫生也不會承認一件事。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "“這病無藥可醫。”"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "這是藉口。這也絕不是醫生該使用的藉口。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "無論受到怎麼樣的威脅，我的醫學知識也不會用於與人道相違之處，而所有生命自誕生起，都有尊嚴。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "醫治礦石病患者是我的天職，無論感染者被當成是什麼。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "所以，我不會放棄任何一個生命，任何一個還可能被治癒的生命。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "但醫生也絕不會否認，有一些措施是我們必須採取的，去阻止更多人受到疾病的侵襲。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "感染者不能成為別人的工具，任何人都不能操控一個生命。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "......如果我什麼都不做，它會成為一個目標、一種武器、一個藉口，如果我們放任它的話，我們並不能向烏薩斯復仇。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "相反，烏薩斯的傷口會成為其他人的傷口。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "我們不能放任一種痛苦的掙扎。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "有些疾病，並不只是普通的醫護人員所能醫治的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "這片大地向他們施加的一切，只會在某些時候被變本加厲地傾瀉給其他人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "——醫生所能做的也就只有這麼多。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "想要去拯救更多生命......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（鳴叫）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "就要做下決定。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "靜謐。\n幹員們戴著過濾系統，他們沉重的呼吸聲清晰可聞。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "所以，我們的目標是確定無疑的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，我們要停止核心城的能源供給，在這之前，我們要解決數量不斷上漲的牧群，杜絕另一場災難的發生。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "Mon3tr，起來！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "......我們的時間不多了。這種結局......甚至稱不上是挽救。那些薩卡茲牧群的結局已經註定了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "凱爾希靜靜地站在那裡，注視著已不能被再稱作是感染者的白色結晶。\n你身上有多少疤痕？她問到。\n你並不知道她是在問那隻顫抖不已的生物，還是在自問自答。\n白色的生物張開雙臂。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你們想要什麼？\n它想要向前挪行，脆弱的雙翼卻支不起它自己的身體。\n聲音從它的喉嚨裡流瀉出來，像是嗚咽，匯成恐怖的河。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我感覺不太對。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "凱爾希",
              "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
              "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
              "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
              "text": "你的預感是正確的。那不是一個普通的感染生物，那是......這場大規模感染的起源。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "真是......美麗的生物。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "凱爾希",
              "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
              "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
              "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
              "text": "非自然的生物，大多出自美學。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "凱爾希",
              "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
              "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
              "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
              "text": "但是，別被外表欺騙，無論它有多美，它都是周遭這一切慘狀的元兇。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "它在唱歌。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
